  "thag1.5:1.1": "yo duddamayo damena danto ",
  "thag1.5:1.2": "dabbo santusito vitiṇṇakaṅkho ",
  "thag1.5:1.3": "vijitāvi apetabheravo hi ",
  "thag1.5:1.4": "dabbo so parinibbuto ṭhitattoti. ",
  "thag1.5:1.5": "itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā dabbo thero gāthaṃ abhāsittha. 6 "
